{"product_id":"iqos-terea-starling-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Starling Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTEREA Starling Pearl offer a smooth tobacco experience with a refined combination of strawberry and basil flavors. The menthol capsule inside enhances the taste, delivering a refreshing, cool sensation with every puff.\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea cigarette\"\u003eterea cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41973864071223,"sku":"Terea Starling Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41973864103991,"sku":"Terea Starling Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/starling-pearl-terea-iqos-cigarette-pack.webp?v=1762191726","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-starling-pearl","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




